---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Nav from "../../components/Nav.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="Security · DefendableCloud"
  description="DefendableCloud security posture: fail-closed production config, RBAC, receipt integrity, dataset access controls, and responsible disclosure."
  path="/security"
>
  <Nav />
  <main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-6 py-20">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium uppercase tracking-widest text-honey-300">Security</p>
    <h1 class="mt-3 text-4xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-paper">Enterprise-grade proof rails.</h1>
    <p class="mt-5 text-lg leading-relaxed text-paper/70">
      DefendableCloud is designed around least privilege, immutable receipts, public-data minimization,
      and production fail-closed controls.
    </p>
    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-5 sm:grid-cols-2">
      {[
        "Production boot checks for secrets, CORS, HTTPS, email, and quotas.",
        "Owner/member RBAC for organization administration.",
        "Magic links and API keys are stored hashed at rest.",
        "Dataset grants are members-only, receipt-backed, quota-limited, and short-lived.",
        "Public receipt views redact storage keys and internal principal IDs.",
        "Cloudflare headers, WAF/rate-limit baseline, and security.txt are published.",
      ].map((item) => (
        <div class="rounded-lg border border-white/8 bg-white/[0.02] p-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-paper/70">
          {item}
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    <section class="mt-12 rounded-xl border border-honey-400/20 bg-honey-300/[0.04] p-6">
      <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-paper">Responsible disclosure</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-paper/70">
        Report suspected vulnerabilities to <a class="text-honey-200" href="mailto:build@defendableos.com">build@defendableos.com</a>.
        Include affected URL, impact, reproduction steps, and whether data exposure is suspected.
      </p>
    </section>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
